=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
  eol soon-month -----------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Proposed: no Figma frame. Ubuntu 22.04, Best effort, on$
# 2027-04-01. Ubuntu names a month, so the notice does too, and$
# counts from its last day.$
$
hardn  v0.4.0              https://github.com/abbott/hardn$
$
# Ubuntu 22.04 (Jammy) #########################################$
$
  [BOS-SAN-L01]            192.0.2.10$
                           182 days, 2 hours, 26 minutes$
$
  [*] Risk Level           Moderate ~ medium security$
$
  [+] User                 + non-root, sudo$
  [+] SSH Login            + root disallowed, key-only auth$
  [+] SSH Port             + non-default (2230)$
  [+] Firewall             + deny policy$
  [+] Kernel               + 6 items applied$
  [ ] Auto Updates         Not Configured$
  [ ] AppArmor             Not Configured$
$
   # Warning: Ubuntu 22.04 support ends May 2027$
   # Upgrade to Ubuntu 26.04.$
$
----------------------------------------------------------------$
$
  Select an option         Mode Live$
$
   1) User                 Create, manage (sudo, SSH keys)$
   2) SSH Login            Disable root and passwords, set port$
   3) Firewall             Manage rules, port listening$
   4) Kernel               Harden sysctl (network, kernel)$
   6) Run All              Queue hardening actions$
   7) Backup               Configure hardn backup$
   8) Configuration        hardn.yml, dns, ntp, syslog$
   9) System Details       View system info$
  10) Logs                 View hardn logs$
$
   0) Exit                 q to quit$
$
    > Option [0-4, 6-10 or q]:$
$
$

